{"slug":"n-d-w","ar":"ن د و","total":53,"core":"calling; assembly","forms":[{"ar":"نَادَىٰ","kind":"verb","form":3,"count":44,"gloss":"to call out, call to","word":null,"ex":{"s":79,"a":23,"p":2,"ar":["فَحَشَرَ","فَنَادَىٰ"],"en":"And he gathered [his people] and called out"}},{"ar":"نَادِي","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"council, associates","word":null,"ex":{"s":96,"a":17,"p":2,"ar":["فَلْيَدْعُ","نَادِيَهُۥ"],"en":"Then let him call his associates"}},{"ar":"نِدَآء","kind":"verbal noun","form":3,"count":2,"gloss":"call, cry","word":null,"ex":{"s":19,"a":3,"p":4,"ar":["إِذْ","نَادَىٰ","رَبَّهُۥ","نِدَآءً","خَفِيًّا"],"en":"When he called to his Lord a private supplication"}},{"ar":"مُنَاد","kind":"active participle","form":3,"count":1,"gloss":"caller","word":null,"ex":{"s":50,"a":41,"p":4,"ar":["وَٱسْتَمِعْ","يَوْمَ","يُنَادِ","ٱلْمُنَادِ","مِن","مَّكَانٍ","قَرِيبٍ"],"en":"And listen on the Day when the Caller will call out from a place that is near"}},{"ar":"مُنَادِي","kind":"active participle","form":3,"count":1,"gloss":"caller","word":null,"ex":{"s":3,"a":193,"p":4,"ar":["رَّبَّنَآ","إِنَّنَا","سَمِعْنَا","مُنَادِيًا","يُنَادِى","لِلْإِيمَـٰنِ","أَنْ","ءَامِنُوا۟","بِرَبِّكُمْ","فَـَٔامَنَّا ۚ","رَبَّنَا","فَٱغْفِرْ","لَنَا","ذُنُوبَنَا","وَكَفِّرْ","عَنَّا","سَيِّـَٔاتِنَا","وَتَوَفَّنَا","مَعَ","ٱلْأَبْرَارِ"],"en":"Our Lord, indeed we have heard a caller calling to faith, [saying], 'Believe in your Lord,' and we have believed. Our Lord, so forgive us our sins and remove from us our misdeeds and cause us to die with the righteous"}},{"ar":"نَدِيّ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"assembly, gathering","word":null,"ex":{"s":19,"a":73,"p":16,"ar":["وَإِذَا","تُتْلَىٰ","عَلَيْهِمْ","ءَايَـٰتُنَا","بَيِّنَـٰتٍ","قَالَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","لِلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","أَىُّ","ٱلْفَرِيقَيْنِ","خَيْرٌ","مَّقَامًا","وَأَحْسَنُ","نَدِيًّا"],"en":"And when Our verses are recited to them as clear evidences, those who disbelieve